        "id": 1527754
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T02:50:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What kind of exceptions are we trying to catch here?\n\nThe function \"getServiceDebugInfo\" does not throw any exception.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/ServiceManager.java;l\u003d338?q\u003dgetServiceDebugInfo%20filepath:java\u0026sq\u003d",
      "revId": "f8eb5364e8d9d1514cff271cb5aede6157770d52",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "97458652_cd1933a9",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/audio/AudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 12335,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T15:53:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Runtime exceptions are unchecked, they are not declared in methods signature. The rationale is that since this is a debugging-related functionality, any problems encountered during its execution must not cause an exception to be propagated further because this will likely result in a termination of the system service which will look like a \"soft restart\" to users.",
      "parentUuid": "fed13d4c_092b513e",
      "revId": "f8eb5364e8d9d1514cff271cb5aede6157770d52",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0f0bf208_90abb351",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/audio/AudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 12335,
      "author": {
        "id": 1630064
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-24T02:58:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was exploring other places, where this method to fetch pids is used.\nIn Watchdog (which also runs in the system server), they use the similar way to get the pids of required processes.\n\nFor Hidl based part only -\u003e RemoteException is checked -\u003e https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/services/core/java/com/android/server/Watchdog.java;l\u003d679 \n\nFor Aidl -\u003e they don\u0027t check any exception, so that\u0027s why I kept the code exception free.\n\nBut, yeah, I get your point, its better to use RuntimeExceptions for debugging related codes.",
      "parentUuid": "97458652_cd1933a9",
      "revId": "f8eb5364e8d9d1514cff271cb5aede6157770d52",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
